### POST Add a Webhook for Notifications
POST http://localhost:4000/api/notifications/webhooks
Authorization: {{AUTH_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "identifier": "testy",
  "url": "https://discord.com/api/webhooks/sdgjkjdbnfjjhn",
  "json_template": "{}"
}

### DELETE a Webhook
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/notifications/webhooks/testy
Authorization: {{AUTH_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### GET Get a Webhook
GET http://localhost:4000/api/notifications/webhooks/testy
Authorization: {{AUTH_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### POST Update a Webhook
